# Identity's generated manifests and quality fixtures include SHA-256 evidence.
# Keep tracked text byte-stable across Windows, macOS, and Linux checkouts.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary projections remain byte-for-byte data, never line-ending-normalized text.
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.png binary
*.webp binary
*.zip binary
